{"action_id":null,"arguments":[],"assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"node.1bf6918f69c6b37738daeb83.a0","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The express circular-specific definition is exhaustive for this measure; ordinary or broader uses of UCITS do not expand it.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.1bf6918f69c6b37738daeb83.a1","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Home-regulator supervision in the introduction describes the purpose; item (ii)'s express condition is home-jurisdiction compliance. Item (i)'s separate supervision condition is not imported.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.1bf6918f69c6b37738daeb83.a2","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The express Effective Date governs the introductory immediate-effect wording.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.1bf6918f69c6b37738daeb83.a3","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Pending application status is assessed at the Effective Date.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.1bf6918f69c6b37738daeb83.a4","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Preservation of the existing process excludes the pending application from this removal, without determining the full contents of that process.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.1bf6918f69c6b37738daeb83.a5","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The identified change is assessed as a whole; no severability rule is inferred.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.1bf6918f69c6b37738daeb83.a6","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"This proposal remains subject to qualifications in unavailable referenced materials.","status":"PROVISIONAL"}],"bundle_hash":"89a0999f703ede4c839bb0f6b76589179bde8042b3064e862b43bbb2b0f1b2fa","candidate_id":"candidate.19149e5ecb1f4d7faf1fc716e273f7d8","controlled_language":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] The result answers whether a selected in-scope material investment change qualifies for item (ii)'s removal of SFC prior approval under the stated assumptions. Within scope, true means the assessment is on or after 28 November 2025, home requirements are met, no listed feature or policy exception applies, and no pre-effective pending application preserves the existing process. False means this removal is unavailable under this reading, not that approval is necessarily required or the fund is non-compliant. A false scope means this control supplies no determination. Unknown facts remain unknown. Notification, filing, post-vetting and overall compliance are not decided.","disposition_reason":"Unreviewed interpretation proposal","family_ids":["scope"],"generation_phase":"SHARED_RESOLUTION","issue_ids":[],"parent_id":"candidate.233d812a168944e6aa5b0c6c64062f2b","probability_of_legal_correctness":null,"revision_reason":"The refinement separates defined fund status, the kind of change and the regulator's selected control. A UCITS domiciled outside the enumerated jurisdictions is outside scope, rather than a failed in-scope eligibility case. A supervised operator change also does not become a material investment change merely because both receive streamlining. The tested rival would make introductory home supervision an additional item (ii) condition: it could exclude an otherwise home-compliant change lacking such supervision. That rival has some support in the introduction, but 'aim at' and the express supervision language in item (i), contrasted with item (ii)'s compliance language, do not establish a second executable condition. The strongest remaining uncertainty is whether the pending-application transition preserves substantive requirements. No comparable fact-bound counterexample was supplied; incomparability diagnostics do not establish disagreement on a shared case.","run_id":"run.57127ace1fc14bbe97f783a02f719446","scheduling_priority":0,"schema_version":"interpretation.v1","score_purpose":"INVESTIGATION_PRIORITY_ONLY","source_packet_hash":"6c557525c251e4c0794c0061ba5b7f7fec9be45d9495dd1ca07063f018b43c06","source_unit_ids":["d97b56331f41a.u1.190","d97b56331f41a.u10.1809","d97b56331f41a.u12.2069","d97b56331f41a.u17.2556","d97b56331f41a.u3.575","d97b56331f41a.u4.653","d97b56331f41a.u5.840","d97b56331f41a.u9.1696"],"status":"ACTIVE","subject_unit":"Eligibility for item (ii)'s prior-SFC-approval removal within the circular's defined UCITS scope"}